// "Erwischt" (docs/STORY.md, Prolog im Detail, section 4): the alarm at 90 % of the core hack. Seen from inside L-7
// (first person) but for one wide take on the Commander. The announcement (tools/voice/lines.json P_ANN_C1-C8, P_AUTO_1)
// sets the length: 31 s with the German placeholder voices, which are the longer. Read by game/scripts/CutsceneScript.cs,
// played live by Cutscene.cs (MACHINES_CUTSCENE_STILLS=<folder>;erwischt;... with MACHINES_STORY=prolog).
//
// The world's part is the story director's, on ticks (plan WP-H): the Reapers and the Commander come in through J, the
// Reapers fire at the core artefact, the core is destroyed, the lights go to emergency. This script only films it and
// adds what is seen and heard; the shots below fly without a sim behind them, so the outcome never changes, and where the
// Reapers or the Commander are not (yet) there the camera looks at the point after "|".
//
// Places on the deck (metres, x east, y north, height over the floor): L-7 hacks at hack_core (88, 106.5) facing north;
// the core (8 x 8 m) stands at 88,116; door J (to the spine) is behind it at x 84-91, y 132-133, so the Reapers come round
// both sides of the core to 78,119, 98,119 and 99,113 (Prologue.ReapersAtCore), where L-7 sees them past it: anything
// behind the core within about 0.7 m sideways per metre beyond L-7 is hidden. Looking north, the west (small x) is on the
// right of the view.

cutscene erwischt
bars 0.12
blend 0.6
// The Reapers' plasma fire and the blasts ran near full scale, 15 dB over the rest of the chapter, and buried the
// announcement: the match's sounds go 10 dB down while it plays (the voices are not on that bus).
world -10

part kern deck
// The alarm: the view lifts from the board to the core. The core chamber keeps its light until the core blows (the
// director's core_blows; the rest of the ship at power_fails).
take alarm 5.5 cockpit locator look=core@8 rate=2
// The door bursts behind the core: the view snaps to the east passage (left of the core), where they come round.
take tuer 4.5 cockpit locator look=210,268,6 rate=1.6
// The Reapers stride round the core, firing; rounds go past.
take sturm 5.5 cockpit locator look=reaper@3|210,261,6 rate=2.2
// The one wide take: from the east side behind the core, where the chamber's light falls, on the Commander coming in behind them.
take kommandant 4.5 cam cam_erwischt_3 look=commander@5|192,294,8 rate=1.5 fov=38 blur=1.2
// They hit the core instead.
take treffer 5.5 cockpit locator look=core@8 rate=2.5
// The core blows, the power fails, the announcement breaks up.
take ausfall 5.5 cockpit locator look=core@14 rate=0.8 fov=66

at 0.0 sound sting_alarm
at 0.0 glitch 0.7 1.2
at 0.1 event alarm
at 0.3 line P_ANN_C1
at 0.4 sound amb_alarm_klaxon db=-8 for=30

// Door J bursts.
at 4.8 sound hull_breach
at 4.9 explosion 192,298,0 6
at 4.9 shake 192,298,6 4 0.5
at 5.0 sparks 192,298,14 amount=70
at 5.2 sparks 186,298,10 amount=40
at 5.6 sound metal_groan_big db=-4
at 6.4 line P_ANN_C2
at 7.0 event reapers in

// Rounds past L-7 (near misses), then at the core.
at 10.4 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 189.2,249.2,4.8 speed=80
at 11.0 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 196.4,247.2,3.4 speed=80
at 11.2 line P_ANN_C3
at 11.7 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 187.8,246.4,6.2 speed=80
at 12.4 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@6 speed=80
at 13.1 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@4 speed=80
at 13.8 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 194.8,248.2,4.4 speed=80
at 14.6 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@8 speed=80
at 15.8 line P_ANN_C4
at 16.2 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@6 speed=80
at 16.9 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@10 speed=80
at 17.5 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@4 speed=80
at 18.6 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@8 speed=80
at 19.2 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@12 speed=80
at 20.4 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@6 speed=80
at 21.0 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@10 speed=80
at 21.2 sparks core@14 amount=50
at 21.2 sound sparks
at 21.5 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@4 speed=80
at 21.8 line P_ANN_C5
at 22.3 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@8 speed=80
at 22.8 sparks core@18 amount=60
at 22.9 glitch 0.35 0.6
at 23.0 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@12 speed=80
at 23.6 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|212,270,6.4 core@6 speed=80
at 24.4 shot PLASMA_RIFLE reaper@3.2|172,270,6.4 core@10 speed=80

// The core blows on "kor-": the power fails, then only the red emergency light and the fire.
at 25.5 explosion core@4 18
at 25.5 sound hull_breach
at 25.5 shake core@8 12 2
at 25.6 glitch 1 1.8
at 25.7 event lights off
// Kept in the core's own footprint: 6 m wide and 8 m high its flames stood as a flat wall right at the view as control came back.
at 25.8 fire core@2 3 4.5
at 26.2 explosion core@16 12
at 26.4 line P_ANN_C6
at 26.9 explosion 200,268,8 8
at 27.4 event lights emergency
at 27.6 line P_ANN_C7
at 28.0 sound sparks
at 28.2 sparks core@22 amount=80
at 29.3 line P_ANN_C8
at 30.4 sound pa_cutoff
at 30.6 event control lost
// The automatic voice comes as the view returns, and runs on into the flight.
at 30.8 line P_AUTO_1
